%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'background': '#ffffff', 'fontSize': '20px', 'fontFamily': 'arial'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver
    participant Auth as AuthController
    participant API as ApiController
    participant Ops as OperationsController
    participant DB as Database
    actor Admin

    %% Phase 1: Driver Registration & Application
    rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
    note right of Driver: Driver Application Phase
    Driver->>Auth: POST /api/auth/register (Driver Details)
    Auth->>DB: Save User (Role: DRIVER)
    Auth-->>Driver: Returns 200 OK & JWT Token
    
    Driver->>API: POST /addBiketaxi (Application Details)
    API->>DB: Save Biketaxi (Status: DRAFT)
    API-->>Driver: Returns 200 OK
    
    Driver->>Ops: POST /api/operations/vehicles/{id}
    Ops->>DB: Save Vehicle (Linked to Biketaxi)
    Ops-->>Driver: Returns 200 OK
    
    Driver->>Ops: POST /api/operations/documents/{id}
    Ops->>DB: Save Document Metadata
    Ops-->>Driver: Returns 200 OK
    end

    %% Phase 2: Admin Verification & Approval
    rect rgb(252, 232, 230)
    note left of Admin: Admin Verification Phase
    Admin->>Auth: POST /api/auth/login (Admin Credentials)
    Auth-->>Admin: Returns 200 OK & Admin JWT Token
    
    Admin->>API: GET /getAllBiketaxi
    API->>DB: Fetch all Applications
    DB-->>API: List of Applications
    API-->>Admin: Returns JSON array of Applications
    
    Admin->>Ops: POST /api/operations/background-checks/{id}
    Ops->>DB: Save BackgroundCheck (Status: INITIATED)
    Ops-->>Admin: Returns 200 OK
    
    Admin->>Ops: PUT /api/operations/documents/{id}/verify
    Ops->>DB: Update Document (Status: VERIFIED, VerifiedBy: Admin)
    Ops-->>Admin: Returns 200 OK
    
    Admin->>API: PUT /api/biketaxi/{id}/status?status=APPROVED
    API->>DB: Update Biketaxi Status to APPROVED
    API->>DB: Trigger AuditLog Creation
    API->>DB: Trigger Notification Creation (To Driver)
    API-->>Admin: Returns 200 OK
    end

    %% Phase 3: Driver Checks Status
    rect rgb(234, 243, 224)
    note right of Driver: Final Status Check
    Driver->>API: GET /getAllBiketaxi (Using Driver JWT)
    API->>DB: Fetch applications where user_id = driver_id
    DB-->>API: Returns Driver's Application
    API-->>Driver: Returns Application JSON (Status: APPROVED)
    end
